rvatives also don't consume the  same sources of information about news  and politics conservatives now inhabit  their own self-created media echo  chamber which functions as a type of  lie-filled and toxic closed episteme and  sealed off universe the creation of such  an alternate reality is an important  attribute of fascism fascism and it then  goes on to cite research by darren  sherket a professor of sociology at  southern illinois university which  demonstrates that america's democracy  crisis may be even more intractable than  the above evidence suggests in his  article cognitive sophistication  religion and the trump vote  shuriket examined data from 2018 and  concluded there are substantial negative  differences between the thinking  processes and cognition cognition of  white trump voters as shown in the 2016  presidential election compared to voters  who supported hillary or another  candidate  circuit observed that trump's support  has been linked to religion and level of  education but until now not to quote  cognitive sophistication which was found  to have a positive effect on voting  but a negative effect on choosing trump  what that means is  cognitive sophistication is defined in  this study  higher cognitive sophistication makes  you more likely to vote  but less likely to vote for trump  and the article very interestingly  explains  low levels of cognitive sophistication  may lead people to embrace  simple cognitive shortcuts like  stereotypes and prejudices  amplified by the trump campaign  additionally the simple linguistic style  presented by trump may have appealed to  voters with limited education and  cognitive sophistication of course of  course we suspected that  beginning with adorno's classic study of  the authoritarian personality empirical  works have linked low levels of  cognitive sophistication with right wing  orientations  last paragraph and then we'll discuss  trump's campaign may also have been more  attractive to people with l